## Tor configuration for the navio-docker `tor` image.
##
## Tor runs next to naviod in the same container as a client only (no relay).
## Its SOCKS and control ports listen on loopback; naviod uses the SOCKS port
## for .onion peers and the control port (cookie auth) to publish its own
## onion service. Replace this file by mounting your own at /etc/tor/torrc.

SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1

DataDirectory /home/navio/.tor

Log notice stdout
